'''Turd''' is an [[NPC]] in {{Zone|Dragontail}}.

== Quest ==
Turd's mother, {{NPCSprite|Suus}}, will ask the player to find Turd's toy by killing {{MobSprite|Magma Cube Rider}}s in the {{Zone|Burning Desert}}. Upon returning the toy, the player receives {{Reputation|barbarian|40}}.

